        "name": "",
        "username": "Thunderbird",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/ba8739/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2023-01-04T00:11:55.984Z",
        "cooked": "<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/2/2974d194885c2930ff34051895dc1ad617f7b02b.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/2974d194885c2930ff34051895dc1ad617f7b02b\" title=\"20230103190512_1\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/2/2974d194885c2930ff34051895dc1ad617f7b02b_2_690x388.jpeg\" alt=\"20230103190512_1\" data-base62-sha1=\"5UJRgxce37mJYfFkr0ptqCUo5FF\" width=\"690\" height=\"388\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/2/2974d194885c2930ff34051895dc1ad617f7b02b_2_690x388.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/2/2974d194885c2930ff34051895dc1ad617f7b02b_2_1035x582.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/2/2974d194885c2930ff34051895dc1ad617f7b02b_2_1380x776.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/2/2974d194885c2930ff34051895dc1ad617f7b02b_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">20230103190512_1</span><span class=\"informations\">1920×1080 299 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>I thought for a minute I might get him pre-flip, but no luck. He took out Sky-Scraper on the first turn on his reverse, and actually had two victims in the safe house to knock himself down to 3 so Idealist could finish him off. Maybe I’d have ended with higher HP using powers more judiciously and thus preventing his healing, but a mint is a mint.</p>",
