        "created_at": "2023-01-04T00:15:13.190Z",
        "cooked": "<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/e/e7d18830f2c1f66072c677b2ec9a7237eda47f90.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/e7d18830f2c1f66072c677b2ec9a7237eda47f90\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/e7d18830f2c1f66072c677b2ec9a7237eda47f90_2_231x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"x4LdnWBxPz6yCQxjP0K2XyXKIcU\" width=\"231\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/e7d18830f2c1f66072c677b2ec9a7237eda47f90_2_231x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/e7d18830f2c1f66072c677b2ec9a7237eda47f90_2_346x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/e7d18830f2c1f66072c677b2ec9a7237eda47f90_2_462x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/e7d18830f2c1f66072c677b2ec9a7237eda47f90_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1170×2532 220 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div><br>\nFinished him the exact turn before he would flip, by having Sky-Scraper cause him to hurt himself! That Sidekick was also super helpful for me, staying around the whole game.</p>",
