        "cooked": "<p>Second try was the charm for me. I feel like I just sort of got a different set of shuffles rather than doing anything strategically better. Though putting Paradoja Figurehead on Idealist was great, she hit him for 20 damage with just a single power, nevermind whatever else she did that turn!</p>",
