      {
        "id": 250241,
        "name": "FrivYeti",
        "username": "FrivYeti",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/frivyeti/{size}/1919_2.png",
        "created_at": "2023-01-04T16:36:07.372Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Mint for me; took him out before he flipped, which is pretty unusual for Spite. The trick for me was mostly just building up a truly staggering hand of cards while fully tricking-out Lifeline and Idealist, and then hitting Spite for 70 damage in a single round through the combination of a 15-card Karate Robot, La Comodora with all of her tricks in play, and some wild Cosmic Immolation shenanigans.</p>",
