      {
        "id": 250264,
        "name": "QuirkyDM",
        "username": "QuirkyDM",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/quirkydm/{size}/2033_2.png",
        "created_at": "2023-01-06T23:11:47.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Mint here. I never even tried for pre-flip victory. Idealist is a beast here, especially with the extra power uses from La Comodora and Lifeline. Skyscraper tanks a lot of damage, especially self-damage when Lifeline brings out Cosmic Immolation and goes nuclear. And Spite often makes things more difficult for himself, letting Chronological Sweetspot being used every turn with no downsides and taking out the environment every turn so I don’t have to.</p>",
        "post_number": 6,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2023-01-06T23:11:47.000Z",
